Welcome to The Southern Frog – Your Perfect Coastal Retreat on 30A

Nestled in the heart of the beautiful WaterColor community, just steps from the stunning beaches of Florida's renowned 30A, The Southern Frog and The Petite Frog offer a spacious, stylish escape with a blend of coastal chic elegance and modern comfort. Designed with crisp white interiors, accented by cool blues and metallic touches, this home perfectly captures the laid-back yet sophisticated spirit of the Florida Panhandle.

Location, Location, Location! Ideally situated within WaterColor, you'll enjoy easy access to the area’s charming boardwalks, with a quick 2-minute bike ride to the newly updated Camp WaterColor, and just a 1-minute stroll to the Frog Pool. Whether you’re exploring nearby shops, dining at local restaurants, or simply lounging by the pool, you’re never far from the best that 30A has to offer.

The Home: The Southern Frog (Main House Only)

- This listing is for the Southern Frog, our beautiful main house. You’ll have full access to the home and outdoor spaces, but please note: - The carriage house (Petite Frog) is not included in this reservation. - We never rent the carriage house to separate guests. If you book only the main house, the carriage house will remain vacant during your stay. - If you’d like to include the carriage house as well, please book: https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1335584435406043798?source_impression_id=p3_1756053602_P3a4Rb9o_mnUdOOH

WE OFFER A STARTER SUPPLY OF PREMIUM GUEST AMENITIES Body Wash | Shampoo | Conditioner | Hand Soap | Toilet Paper | Dish Soap | Dishwasher Pods | Laundry Detergent | Paper Towels | Trash Bags | Dish Sponge | Bath towels | Bed linens

IMPORTANT PRIOR TO ARRIVAL All guests will be required to sign a rental agreement, as well as provide a valid ID that matches with the name of the person that made the reservation. *Must be 25 years of age to book. Guests under 25 must be accompanied by a parent or guardian that is staying on premises.

